+
+### Alert digest (one request per worker cycle)
+
+The worker sends `{ "alerts": [<Alert>, ...], "count": N, "window_to": "ISO8601",
+"subject": "Log Anomaly Explorer: N alerts", "message": "plain-text digest" }`.
+Each Alert has the five fields shown above. Legacy top-level fields mirror the first
+Alert. Email integrations must map `subject` and `message` to one email, without
+iterating the array. Normal clusters and clusters within cooldown are excluded.
+Only a successful webhook response marks pending clusters alerted and starts cooldown.
